{
    "title": "Dancing Dress - Fashion Girl",
    "description": "<b>This is a lighthearted game, a new way to enjoy the music!\r\nBecome the dress princess, avoid obstacles and finish the fashion runway. Get super long dress to the rhythm of music.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>At Dancing Dress you can experience music of different styles and singers, and change your modeling with amazing and interesting choices! </b>\r\n\r\n<b>\u3010Easy to play\u3011</b>\r\n- Swipe left and right\r\n- Try to get more dress to get more rewards\r\n- Be careful not to encounter obstacles\r\n\r\n<b>\u3010Game Features\u3011</b>\r\n- Simple game control experience\r\n- Number of songs to satisfy different tastes \r\n\r\n<b>\u3010Music Choices\u3011</b>\r\n- Hot songs as: <u>Dance Monkey/Despacito/How You Like That/Unity/Senorita.</u>\r\n- Super artists as:<u> Ava Max/Lady Gaga/Post Malone/Billie Eilish/Justin Bieber.</u>\r\n\r\nTry it now! Music lovers will love it!\r\n\r\nIf any producer or record label has a problem with any of the music used in the game please email us and if necessary it will be removed immediately (including images used).\r\n\r\nHow to contact us:\r\nPlease send an email to contact@potatogamesstudio.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>This is a lighthearted game, a new way to enjoy the music!<br>Become the dress princess, avoid obstacles and finish the fashion runway. Get super long dress to the rhythm of music.</b><br><br><b>At Dancing Dress you can experience music of different styles and singers, and change your modeling with amazing and interesting choices! </b><br><br><b>\u3010Easy to play\u3011</b><br>- Swipe left and right<br>- Try to get more dress to get more rewards<br>- Be careful not to encounter obstacles<br><br><b>\u3010Game Features\u3011</b><br>- Simple game control experience<br>- Number of songs to satisfy different tastes <br><br><b>\u3010Music Choices\u3011</b><br>- Hot songs as: <u>Dance Monkey/Despacito/How You Like That/Unity/Senorita.</u><br>- Super artists as:<u> Ava Max/Lady Gaga/Post Malone/Billie Eilish/Justin Bieber.</u><br><br>Try it now! Music lovers will love it!<br><br>If any producer or record label has a problem with any of the music used in the game please email us and if necessary it will be removed immediately (including images used).<br><br>How to contact us:<br>Please send an email to contact@potatogamesstudio.com",
